    "detailed_description": "Astral Horizon is a first-person space opera adventure featuring combat with six degrees of freedom. Give orders to your squadmates and find creative ways to approach combat in zero-gravity. Explore epic sci-fi locations as you fight a war to uncover a perspective-shattering discovery.<br><br>In the distant future, humanity has broken the cosmological speed limit and colonized solar systems many lightyears from Earth. At the very edge of human civilization, an ex-pirate, a navy pilot, and the head of a clandestine corporation find themselves fighting in a war over the advancement of scientific knowledge. Past the horizon of our understanding, no one can say what horrors may await us.<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Master a six-degrees-of-freedom movement system to ambush, evade, and overcome all obstacles.<br></li><li>Pilot a fighter at breakneck speeds to make the decisive blow in epic space battles.<br></li><li>Wield a wide range of futuristic weaponry to dispatch enemies in creative ways.<br></li><li>Experience multiple perspectives in a galaxy-spanning war.<br></li><li>Uncover the truth that lies beyond the horizon...</li></ul>",
